          "text": "Description: On December 6, 1981, around 8:35 PM, witnesses observed an unusual light phenomenon in the sky. All noticed a set of glowing circular shapes moving at irregular speeds within a confined perimeter. No sound was heard, and the phenomenon remained visible for approximately one hour before fading into the horizon. We lack data to propose any hypotheses regarding the origin of this phenomenon.",
